{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269QD5ivH9281794213903.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太區股市普遍上升。</p><p></p><p>日本股市曾升逾百分之3，但未能企穩59,000點水平，收市升幅收窄至約百分之2。</p><p></p><p>台灣股市造好，一度急漲逾百分之6。終止過去7日跌勢，並突破4萬點大關。澳洲股市反彈，穩守9,000點水平。</p><p></p><p>韓國股市則先升後回落，連跌第三日。跌幅不足百分之1。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.048432+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T08:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:16:23.916092+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:28.734781+00:00","content_hash":"8e810b5cdd4cbc719c155dadc6fb86edccfc26176047774d270c50602a69385b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.048432+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}